<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53089" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάνθᾰρος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dung-beetle, Scarabaeus
			pilularius</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				490a15
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				10.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				695
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Crates Theb.
				10.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				5.114
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aesop.
				7
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Αἰτναῖος κ</span>., a
			specially large kind, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				233
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ichn.</u>
				300
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Epich.
				76
			</span></i>: prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κανθάρου σκιαί</span>, of
			some paltry fear, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Diogenian.
				5.88
			</span></i>; so 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀθυμῶν ὅτι αὐτοῦ καταθέουσι δύο
					κανθάρω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					91.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a sort of
				<i>drinking-cup</i> with large handles, <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.Com.
				15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Amips.
				2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Axionic.
				7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> a kind of
				<i>Naxian boat</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				143
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sosicr.
				2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nicostr.Com.
				10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>black sea-bream, Cantharus lineatus</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				598a10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b> in Egypt,
				<i>mark</i> or <i>knot</i> on the tongue of the Apis-bull,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>VI.</b>
			<i>woman's ornament</i>, prob. a gem in scarab-form, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				61
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
